ive percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  26 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 14 44 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fragment of breast tissue with a 1 0cm firm tan mass abutting the inked surface  A representative section of the mass is frozen as FX 1  per surgeon s request  and is resubmitted in cassette A  The remainder of the tumor is submitted in B D  The remainder of the specimen is submitted in cassettes E F  One long and one short suture inferior margin  two short deep margin  two long lateral margin  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast  2  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm portion of oriented breast tissue with two short sutures designating the deep margin  black   two long sutures the lateral margin  blue   and one long and one short suture   the inferior margin  The deep margin is inked black  the anterior is green  the lateral is blue  and the medial is red  The specimen is serially sectioned from superior to inferior to reveal unremarkable fatty parenchyma  No discrete lesions or masses are identified  Specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes G O  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  RICHARD AMMER  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  RIGHT BREAST  BIOPSY  INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  MARYAM S  MOHAMMADKHANI  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Lawrence R  Zukerberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT  1  EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT  2  EXCISION   report_end  , Unchec