tiple tiny  clear fluid cysts and focally marbled with adipose tissue  Multiple lymph nodes are disected from the axillary tail ranging in size from 0 2cm up to 1 0cm in diameter  The largest lymph node is at the edge of the axillary tail most distant from the breast  SECTION CODE A  underlying biopsy site and recent incision  B C  posterior biopsy site  D  superior biopsy site  E  medial biopsy site  F  inferior biopsy site  G H  superior resection margin  I J  posterior resection margin  K  unremarkable parenchyma  medial to biopsy site  L  grossly unremarkable parenchyma  medial aspect of specimen  M N  one half of multiple small lymph nodes  O  representative section of largest lymph node  P  areola and nipple  Resident  Rex Neal Smith  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Andrew Louis Warshaw  M D  James Warren May Jr   M D  Keith Thomas Paige  M D  Frederick Joseph Duffy  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT  , Unchecked.
