gins F  sections through slightly firm tissue from the short stitch  which is black   Labeled  right axillary lymph level 1  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm aggregate of fibrofatty tissue sectioned to reveal several pink tan lymph nodes  many of which are fatty  the largest measuring 2 0cm in greatest dimension  Representative sections are in G L  Labeled  right axillary lymph node  level 2  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of fibrofatty tissue sectioned to reveal hemorrhagic fibrofatty tissue with no obvious lymph nodes  Representative sections are submitted in M and N  Labeled  right axillary hot spot 0  CT  119  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm lymph node containing central 0 5cm firm  white tissue  entirely submitted in O  Resident  MARISA BALDASSANO  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA  LEVEL I   EXCISION PART C  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA  LEVEL II   EXCISION PART D  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA   HOT SPOT 0    EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
