r green  and inferior yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral to reveal an excision cavity measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm located in the inferior medial portion of the specimen  The cavity is located 0 3cm from the closest anterior margin  0 2cm from the closest inferior margin  1 5cm from the medial margin  3 5cm from the lateral margin  0 5cm from the posterior margin  and 1 7cm from the superior margin  Representative sections of the cavity  from medial to lateral  are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the unremarkable breast parenchyma away from the resection cavity are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1 AND 1A  SENTINEL NODE  1  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Gross Dictation by Michael W Lawlor M D   Ph D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Michael W Lawlor M D   Ph D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   on REMOVED_DATE Amendment by John H Eichhorn M D   on REMOVED_DATE Amendment  1 by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLARY  SENTINEL   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION , Unchecked.
