ormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  20 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 13 43 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right breast mass   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm fragment of breast  which is inked and sectioned to reveal a white pink  ill defined firm nodule occupying the whole specimen  No frozen section is done  The specimen is submitted entirely in cassette A  Resident  STEPHEN LAU  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  NO AREA SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  EDI BROGI  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST MASS   report_end  , Unchecked.
