cm cystic cavity along the superior aspect which contains a tan yellow  soft necrotic substance  The cavity comes to 0 3cm of the deep margin  The remaining cut surface shows focally cystic and gritty grey white fibrous tissue  no discrete mass or other gross abnormality  Sectioning of the upper outer quadrant reveals several tan red rubbery lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 1 4cm in greatest dimension  Representative sections are submitted  SECTION CODE  A D  Hemorrhagic cavity including deep margin as A B D  and including the first silver metal clip as B C  E  Fibrous tissue containing second silver metal clip  F  Necrotic cavity to deep margin  G  Representative fibrous tissue  H    Six whole lymph nodes  Gross Description by  STEPHANIE KUEHN Resident  PAULA ARNELL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Simon Powell  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
