 necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  05 REMOVED_MONTH 03 at 15 05 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right mastectomy and axillary contents is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm right mastectomy specimen with attached REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm axillary tail  with a short stitch designating superior  now redesignated as 12 o clock  and a long stitch designating axillary contents  The specimen is surfaced by a REMOVED_DATE x 9 0cm tan white skin ellipse with an eccentric REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm nipple that comes to within 1 4cm of the 5 o clock margin  Located 3 4cm superior lateral to the nipple is a 1 7cm well healed  firm  linear scar  3 8cm from the 12 o clock margin  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 6cm tan  firm  hemorrhagic  ill defined mass that comes to within 2 3cm from the black inked deep margin and 2 2cm from the skin surface  Subjacent to the surface scar is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm area of calcifications  and comes to within 4 5cm from the mass  Located 6 5cm superior lateral to the mass is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm area of calcifications that abut the anterior blue inked surface and comes to within 0 3cm of the posterior black inked surface  The remainder of the tissue is predominantly tan yellow  unremarkable fatty tissues admixed with a scant amount of tan white fibrous tissue  Multiple tan  rubbery lymph nodes are identified in the axillary fat  ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A C  Tumor to deep margin  D  Tumor  E  Uninvolved tissue medial to tumor  F  Uninvolved tissue  lateral to tumor  G H  Calcifications  subjacent to scar  I  Calcifications lateral to mass  J  Four whole lymph nodes  K  Tw