illary lymph nodes   is a REMOVED_DATE x 4 5cm portion of adipose tissue containing multiple lymph nodes  the largest measuring 1 3cm  The lymph nodes are submitted in cassettes L O  Resident  SELIM NASSER  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  David L Berger  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA   DISSECTION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   LUMPECTOMY , Unchecked.
