eptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  23 AUG 97 at 08 55 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast mass  is a 4 x 4 x 2 5cm piece of firm breast with localizing wire  The breast is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x 2 x 1 5cm firm  tan white  gritty mass with a stellate border  in areas coming to  0 5cm of the inked resection margin  Representative section of the mass are frozen as FX 1  other representative section are submitted through cassette A and G  Resident  RUBEN D  CARRASCO  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   RIGHT BREAST MASS   INFILTRATING CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  SAHA SADEGHI  MD O R  Diagnosis by  H  Thomas Aretz  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
