D TISSUE FOR HORMONE RECEPTOR PROTEINS BREAST  LEFT   The tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein  The tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein  See note  Note  In this laboratory  we used this antibody to stain 100 breast carcinomas prepared in the usual way  paraffin sections  and we compared the results with determinations of estrogen receptor by biochemical assay  91  of tumors that stained with this antibody were positive for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  96  of tumors that failed to stain with this antibody were negative for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  When we compared the results of staining of paraffin sections with the results of staining of frozen sections  the predictive value of a positive result was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  16 MAY 97 at 15 52 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab in two parts  each  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  Labeled  Perm   is a 3 x 2 x 2cm  grossly firm  white tissue with infiltrating borders  No frozen slides  The frozen tissue is saved for cytogenetics  Tissue is submtted for estrogen receptors and BRDU  Labeled  Left breast tissue  are three fragments of fibrofatty tissue  measuring in aggregate 1 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  entirely frozen as Frozen Section  1 and saved frozen  The entire breast tissue from both specimens is submitted in cassettes A through F  Resident  Essam Ahmed  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  LEFT   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Cynthia E  Flynn  MD O R  Diagnosis by  John H  Eichhorn  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  ELLISON 08 REPORTS TO  Jo Buyske  M D  PART A  LEFT BREAST BIOPSY PART B  LEFT BREAST TISSUE   report_end  , Unchecked.
